{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos.md","title":"Theorem — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯","display":"Theorem — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos","aliases":["14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos"],"display":"Theorem — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯","source_ref":"I.4, p.35; I.8, pp.54–56","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]","[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.4, p.35; I.8, pp.54–56"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd3ceef5571a783f\" href=\"?note=dd3ceef5571a783f\" title=\"14-df-group-action-exponentials\">14-df-group-action-exponentials</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"78d84752064c9948\" href=\"?note=78d84752064c9948\" title=\"14-df-boolean-topos\">14-df-boolean-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 及群运算沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a> 的完整数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G\">\\(BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G\\)</span> 采用该条构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(|X|,\\rho_X)\">\\(X=(|X|,\\rho_X)\\)</span> 为作用对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq|X|\">\\(A\\subseteq|X|\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 稳定子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A,\\mathcal S_G(X)\">\\(\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A,\\mathcal S_G(X)\\)</span> 为以下构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_G=(\\{0,1\\},((v,g)\\mapsto v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_G,\\Omega_G,(*\\mapsto1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_G=(\\{0,1\\},((v,g)\\mapsto v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_G,\\Omega_G,(*\\mapsto1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_A=\\{(x,1)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0)\\mid x\\in|X|\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A=(X,\\Omega_G,f_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_A=\\{(x,1)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0)\\mid x\\in|X|\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A=(X,\\Omega_G,f_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}(\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true}),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(BG).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}(\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true}),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(BG).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_G(X)=\\{A\\subseteq|X|\\mid\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\rho_X(x,g)\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_G(X)=\\{A\\subseteq|X|\\mid\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\rho_X(x,g)\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\;(|X|\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\land A\\cup(|X|\\setminus A)=|X|\\land A\\cap(|X|\\setminus A)=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\;(|X|\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\land A\\cup(|X|\\setminus A)=|X|\\land A\\cap(|X|\\setminus A)=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_G\">\\(\\Omega_G\\)</span> 保留完整的平凡作用结构，true 和特征映射均为真正的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 箭头。稳定子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 表示对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\rho_X|_{A\\times G})\">\\((A,\\rho_X|_{A\\times G})\\)</span> 及其带标签的包含箭头。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin A\">\\(x\\notin A\\)</span> 却有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xg\\in A\">\\(xg\\in A\\)</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}\">\\(g^{-1}\\)</span> 就得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>，矛盾。因此补集稳定，特征函数取平凡作用而等变，集合分类方块也是作用范畴中的拉回。有限极限逐底集计算，指数已在前一原子构造，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯；每个子对象均有补，故 Boolean。每个抽象子对象由其等变单射的稳定像代表，因而上述子集计算确实证明了全部子对象可补。群的可逆性是补集稳定的关键；一般幺半群作用不能套用此结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.4, p.35; I.8, pp.54–56。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-group-action-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"dd3ceef5571a783f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-boolean-topos","status":"resolved","id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及群运算沿用 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 的完整数据；$BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G$ 采用该条构造。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$ 为作用对象，$A\\subseteq|X|$ 为 $G$ 稳定子集。$\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A,\\mathcal S_G(X)$ 为以下构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G","display":false},{"tex":"X=(|X|,\\rho_X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq|X|","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A,\\mathcal S_G(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_G=(\\{0,1\\},((v,g)\\mapsto v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_G,\\Omega_G,(*\\mapsto1)).","display":true},{"tex":"f_A=\\{(x,1)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0)\\mid x\\in|X|\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A=(X,\\Omega_G,f_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}(\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true}),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(BG).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_G(X)=\\{A\\subseteq|X|\\mid\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\rho_X(x,g)\\in A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\;(|X|\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal S_G(X)\\land A\\cup(|X|\\setminus A)=|X|\\land A\\cap(|X|\\setminus A)=\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega_G","display":false},{"tex":"BG","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"(A,\\rho_X|_{A\\times G})","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin A","display":false},{"tex":"xg\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"g^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"BG","display":false}],"bytes":2490,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos|thm-199 — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-group-action-boolean-topos|thm-199 — 群作用拓扑斯是 Boolean 拓扑斯]]"}],"outgoing":["ff1dddefb4838916","dd3ceef5571a783f","78d84752064c9948","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","d3923e299ec2ec5a"]}